<title>UK: INTERVIEW-ICI chief hails Unilever deal.</title>
<headline>INTERVIEW-ICI chief hails Unilever deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Chemical Industries Plc chief executive Charles Miller Smith said on Wednesday the company first looked at Unilever NV /Plc's speciality chemicals businesses &quot;almost 12 months ago to the week&quot;.</p>
<p>Miller Smith told Reuters acquisition of the businesses was &quot;a genuinely unique opportunity to change (ICI) and create a lot of value&quot;.</p>
</text>
